{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LG79SuR1F11795413208.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產玖瓏山分行經理霍栢雄表示，近期整體租賃氣氛正面，分行最新錄西沙Sierra Sea 2A期5座中層C室，單位實用面積647平方呎，3房連套房及儲物房間隔，議價後以32,800元獲承租，實用平均呎租50.7元。</p><p><br/>中原霍栢雄指，新租客為區內客，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主則於2026年2月以978萬元買入單位，是次租出單位可享約4厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.826455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:14.030605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:17.555398+00:00","content_hash":"b6c5a34210e5b9be881b9618db1ce98c3c0d114ea3783651e3a8cfc412ca1a4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.826455+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}